    "caption": "當血管原本就不健康，又突然承受極大壓力，\n血壓大幅升高，就可能誘發心肌梗塞，甚至中風。\n\n🌟看完這集，重新檢視自己的生活習慣，也分享給身邊的親友吧！\n#HappyHabit #剛剛好就衡好",
    "audioUrl": "https://instagram.fcyw3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNSNng9TztpgZcodfxf5tuVzyh-fSKilxPIWZ3e580cGbK0s9ghfsMqXkVF3FEGKQgOmkG29qFrMOOOZAeDmBBZSSZoQry6oPDm9q4.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdqS4xdXLoa3yPfP46uIB3nCCdiO63JA69F_tXYihaiOGUVm4pBa1odUQuZuDX0kOVs&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fcyw3-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=saQwphbnPQ4Q7kNvwEiAodT&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=NDgz0dolrxkzwVB8BED_Qw&_nc_ss=7a22e&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQOiJJpRoXaYS7NrK1qcJEu-5KCkehWgc_IA5wB7N3kv2w&oe=6ABBD40E",
