    "caption": "你有過這些情況嗎？👀\n📖 看字變得模糊\n📱 滑手機時，線條看起來歪歪的\n⬛ 視野中央出現一塊暗影\n\n別忽略眼睛發出的訊號，這些情況可能代表黃斑部出現變化🔍\n記得把這集存起來，也分享給長時間用眼的朋友！\n\n#HappyHabit #剛剛好就衡好",
    "audioUrl": "https://scontent-waw2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPbDNNZnYVqP2uruOgwGW2qFf3pTi4XwqYoAkTmAwb6tKF8BseNj-FLWq230LcHJ9AV_eyN7OmRc6Nai4iyAhB2nPYcHCqIQlQOdEI.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-waw2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=awfMdunxyRQQ7kNvwHmoEKB&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ak5RWz9_jE-5Ady6LHzq9g&_nc_ss=7a22e&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQM_W7FnRNSQ0Yh89OaNviV8e9_0HEDLvSDpas7l-cC3-w&oe=6ABBED0D",
